<title>UK: TABLE-Hanson H1 pretax profit 47.8 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hanson H1 pretax profit 47.8 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.5		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Pretax		     47.8		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Dividend		   4.0		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,137.8		vs 1,141.0</p>
<p>NOTE - H1 pretax profit was after a charge of 49.1 million stg.</p>
<p>H1 operating profit rose nine percent to 121 million stg.</p>
<p>Above results are pro forma, reflecting Hanson's demerger.</p>
<p>Full company name - Hanson Plc.</p>
